    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this stunning 4 bedroom 3 bathroom end of terrace property to the market for sale. \n\nThis property comes to the market with clean lines and modern décor throughout having been meticulously well maintained by its current owners. The property comprises of the entrance hallway, kitchen/dining, sunroom, living room and guest wc all downstairs. Upstairs there are four great sized bedrooms, the main of which is ensuite together with the family sized bathroom. The property is not overlooked from the rear offering ample privacy at all times. Access to large sun filled rear garden can be via the gated side entrance to same. There is ample parking to the front of the property ideal for a number of vehicles. \n\nArdevan Rise is a popular estate and is situated within walking distance of all local amenities that Monasterevin has to offer including primary and secondary schools, creches, local shops, bars, garage and much more. The town has a fantastic bus service, train station and access to the motorway is only a stones throw making this an ideal choice for any commuter. \n\nExpect to be impressed. Viewing is highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, light fitting, radiator \n\nKitchen/Dining: Wooden flooring, spot lights and light fittings, fully fitted modern kitchen, area fully plumbed, stainless steel sink, tiled splash back, oven, hob, extractor fan, doorway access to sunroom and living room, radiator \n\nSunroom: Wooden flooring, light fitting, sliding patio door to rear garden, radiator \n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, spot lights, feature electric fireplace, radiator \n\nLanding: Wooden flooring, light fitting, attic access, hot press with shelving and storage\n\nMaster Bedroom: Wooden flooring, light fitting, fully fitted wardrobe, radiator \n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, shower, WHB, WC, radiator \n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring, light fitting, fully fitted wardrobe, radiator \n\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring, light fitting, fully fitted wardrobe, radiator\n\nBedroom 4: Wooden flooring, light fitting, wardrobe, radiator \n\nFamily Bathroom: Light fitting, tiled surround, bath with electric shower, WHB, WC, radiator \n\nFeatures:\n\nHardwood front door\nSelected curtains and light fittings included\nWired for Satellite TV\nWired for Broadband/WiFi\nHardwood double glazed windows\nOutside tap\nOutside light\nShed with ESB\nNot overlooked\nLandscaped and mature gardens\nPatio area to rear\nMains water\nMains sewage\nNew hot water boiler (Installed in 2025)\nOil fired central heating (Newly installed in 2025)\nBuilt in 2004\nc.122.77sqmt \n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
